<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68485" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονιός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, but 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μούνιος</span></b>  Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.118
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>solitary</i>, of male beasts which have been driven from the
			herd: hence, <i>savage, ferocious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. δάκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Dian.</u>
					84
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μούνιος ἐκ θάμνοιο λύκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.289
				</span></i>
			 (Antip. Thess.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ep.Sat.</u>
				34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst., <i>solitary wild boar</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς ἄγριος ὁ μὴ τοῖς ἄλλοις
					συναγελαζόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			), 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς ἄγριος</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Aesop.
				407
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἄγριος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					79(80).13
				</span></i>
			 (v.l.).</div>
